            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A locker system including a plurality of lockers, an augmented reality headset comprising a display, and a controller communicatively coupled to the lockers and the augmented reality headset. The controller comprises a memory and a processor for executing instructions stored on the memory. The instructions, are configured to generate a locker assignment to assign an individual locker to the user or to associate the individual locker with identification information associated with the user, communicate the locker assignment to the user using the augmented reality headset, output instructions, based at least in part on the locker assignment, configured to cause the augmented reality headset to display a symbol and prompt the user to perform a gesture mimicking the symbol displayed, and control operation of the individual locker based on signals received from the augmented reality headset of the user, the signals being indicative of the user performing the gesture.</p>
            </abstract>
